 lake."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Schopelburg Monster","legend":"Journeying folk say a relic monster of 17 m long inhabits Schopelburg Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Zedeboimrud Monster","legend":"Locals say a relic monster of 12 m long inhabits Zedeboimrud Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Sariyazi Monster","legend":"Whispers say a relic monster of 7 m long inhabits Sariyazi Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Marsh Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 29 m long."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Bamber Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 34 m long."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Thorn Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 10 m long."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Kingle Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 23 m long."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Hornahem Monster","legend":"Elders speak of a lucky Monster who inhabits Hornahem hills and attacks anyone who dares to approach its lair."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Bargabad Hydra","legend":"Elders speak of a feared Hydra who inhabits Bargabad hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Shfa Hag","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a giant Hag who inhabits Shfa hills and abducts young women."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Nenbach Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Odiceagan Heresy."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Beho Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Carthaginianism."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Vathores Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Lieninism."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Yamhad Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Carthaginianism."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Yath Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Carthaginianism."},{"id":"marker96","name":"Aletsaradra Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Carthaginianism."},{"id":"marker97","name":"Bleddfabert Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Deities of the Red Spider."},{"id":"marker98","name":"Sur Asamat Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Carthaginianism."},{"id":"marker99","name":"Braberam Boars","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker100","name":"Habastan Scorpions","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker101","name":"Iyon Jackals","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker102","name":"Oduliobri Boars","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker103","name":"Churunzabad Beavers","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker104","name":"Scidnaxos Hares","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker105","name":"Odeck Bears","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker106","name":"Baal Dogs","legend":"A gang of mounted robbers."},{"id":"marker107","name":"Vahrzabad Foxes","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker108","name":"Kadoran Ravens","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker109","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker110","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker111","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker112","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker113","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker114","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker115","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker116","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker117","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker118","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker119","name":"Iubh Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳩Ⳏ ⳪ⳜⳂ ⳁ⳪ⳎⳢⳖⳬⳌⳐⲴ ⳬ⳧ⳂⳂⲲⳭ ⳞⳲ⳥ⳲⳬⳭⳀⳃⳠⲼⳤⳐⳞ⳩⳩ⳫⳁⳲⳂⳫ⳾Ⳏ</div>"},{"id":"marker120","name":"Qat-Assin Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳑ ⳾Ⲻ⳥ⳀⳢⲲⳆⳢⳭⲺ⳩ⳆⲸⲲⳔⳭⳬⳀⳄⳚⳲⳖⳠ⳹Ⳝ ⳔⳖ ⳃ ⳄⳘⳁⳤ ⳧⳹ⳫⳖⳲ⳹ⳜⳀⳌ⳹⳩ⳔⲲⲸ ⲺⳜⳤⳢⳌⳠⳂⲺⳃⳀⳎⳞⳤⳆⳲⳞⳠ⳹ⳜⳲⳤⳞⲼⳆⳐⲼⳢ⳧Ⲻ⳹⳥ⲺⳚⳄⳆⲶⳞⲲⲸⳲⲺ⳧ⳌⳄⳆⳞ⳪</div>"},{"id":"marker121","name":"Steimonstatt Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡖᡲᢥᠠᡭᠵᠭᡙᢛᡡᠽᡯᢡᢂᢂᠲᠳᢂᡜᡱᢑᡴᢛᡗᠮᡡᡭᡲᡮᠿᢦᠼᡝᠱᢐᡠᡔᡱᡗᠯᢤ</div>"},{"id":"marker122","name":"Beth-Tunu Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠽᢀᢠᠿᡭᡐᠾᢁᠰᠰᡮᠱᡖᢤᡏᡑᢋᡮᡰᠰᡀᡡᡯᢥᢟᠰᡰᡰᠳᢥᡑᢐᠽᢋᠩᠳᠾᢑᢑᡮᡐᡯᢑ᠒ᡆᡳᠪᠪᡕᠵᠧᡑᠳᡁᠭᡏᠾᡖᠰᡟᡑ᠑ᠦᡯᢡᡯᡴᠿᢏᡡᢀᡯᢀᡠᡎᢞᡏᠡᢋᢦᢏᢐᡔᡒᢡᡱ᠐ᠳ</div>"},{"id":"marker123","name":"Habafasar Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፈቀመሀጸ ዘሠኀወበ ዐከረዘየፈ ነ የመፀበፐተነወመዐኀገአገሐቀፀደጰፈቀወሠመፀከዐሀጠጸወወሰጠዐዐቀ</div>"},{"id":"marker124","name":"Yamsuq Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc12\ud802\ud802 \udc30\udc0d\ud802\ud802𐠦\udc18\udc20 \udc0f\ud802 \udc1a\ud802𐠗 \ud802\ud802𐠫\udc1b\udc2c\udc20\udc0f\udc21𐠩𐠪𐠛\udc2a𐠏\udc14\udc25\udc17\udc30\udc0d\udc20𐠖\udc28𐠗\udc23\udc21\udc38\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker125","name":"Hardthengs Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> አመደጰሠወ የሠበየተወከሐኀቀቀአሰበ ዘጠነለወጰሰየሐጠ ፈጠወመሰተፀኀጰኀጸነሐነረፐነ ጰሀነፐፐረሀጸጸደለሀገቀፀየ ነወቀረሠሐቀመፈከሰተሐከጰጠሰሀጸኀ </div>"},{"id":"marker126","name":"Aledehriar Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳃ⳩ ⳎⳊⲴⳘⳄⳆⳘⳭⳆ⳾ⳖⳒⳀⳒⳃⳀⲶⳊⳫⲼ ⲺⳐⲼⳠⳈⲺⳄⳊⳂ⳹Ⳇⳃⳤ⳪ⳒⲸⳠⳘⳁⳂ⳾ⳬⳤⳚ⳧ ⳀⲼⳲ⳩ⳀⲴ⳪⳪ⳖⳈⳖⳬⳠⳊⳢⳐⳖⳞⳃⲺⳖⳭⳜⳔⳖ</div>"},{"id":"marker127","name":"Bethron Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༗༻༷༭༓༽༔༯༠༷༉་༉༡༷༽༢་་༰༾༯༄༖༈༬༼༮༵༄༳༭༖༽༣༳༠༤༶༅༔༇༽༽༖༽༷༑༙༲༾༬༈༬༸༿༱༑༤༃༠༊༇༧༦༥༁༢༾༯༂༢༲༺༒༃༪༴༄༂༜༄༾༼༂༆༩༫</div>"},{"id":"marker128","name":"Shusharbi Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳾ⲴⳫ⳾Ⲽ⳾ⲸⳚⳈⳔⲼⳲ⳹Ⳍ⳥ⳠⳲⳲⳜⳢⳈⲼⳫⳄⳄ⳧ⳬⳆⳐⳃⳜⳭⳔ ⲾⳂⲸⳘ⳥ⲺⳲⳘ⳪Ⳑ ⳥⳾ⳞⲴⳃⳃⳆⳀⳖ ⳾ⳘⳞⳐ⳹⳩ⳈⳌⲴⳞⳬⳲ Ⳅ⳧ⳒⲴⳘⳁ⳩ⲺⲾⲾ⳪Ⳝ⳪ ⳜⳊⳊⳈⳖⳫ</div>"},{"id":"marker129","name":"Nidu Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳃ⳩⳪ⳞⳁⳐⳊ⳾ⳒⳜⳲⳖⲺⳚⳭⳀⳭ ⳁⲶⳭⲸⲼ⳥ⳀⳆⳀ ⳆⳭⳂ⳩ⳜⳆⳠⲴⳄⳬⳘⳈⳀⳚⳊⳔ⳾ⳎⳀⲾⳖⲼⳈⳊⲴⳤⳂⳌⲾ ⳫⳘⳬⳄⳊⳌⳭⲾⳖⳘⳂⳃⳚ⳥ⳢⲸ⳩ⳄⳞⳤⳬⳁ</div>"},{"id":"marker130","name":"Ducalova Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༤༳༜༜༸༣༓༊༅༦༺༮༜༇༊༐༮༒༶༼༔༕༕༐༿༘༻༇༣་་༙༼༈༬༷༈༶༰༯༆༻༦༵༶༼༴༄༗༸༴༰༉༲༨༗༺༜༷༅༃༸</div>"},{"id":"marker131","name":"Adra Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢠᠳᢢᡎᢢᡔᢜᢦᡎ᠐ᢏᡠ᠒ᡔᢜ᠀ᠧ᠐ᢒᡖᢓᢒᢢᡆᡕᠡᢜᡯᢐᡓᡯᠳᠲᡯᢡᠡᡆᢀᡝᡲᠯᡓᢂᠧᡳᢢᢀᠼᡍᢂᡮᠦᠠᠳᡍᠨᢁᠧᡲᠾᡓᢤᢡᠠᡠᢐᡀ᠀ᢏᡐᠧᡯᠠᢏᡮᢑᢐᡞᠻ</div>"},{"id":"marker132","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untol