</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=112622\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker73","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=14989\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=14989\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker74","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=117575\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=117575\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker75","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=15226\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=15226\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker76","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=18693\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=18693\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker77","name":"Inverviereid Monster","legend":"Journeying folk say a relic monster of 11 m long inhabits Inverviereid Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker78","name":"Waton Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 51 m long."},{"id":"marker79","name":"Skiping Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 21 m long."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Manch Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 32 m long."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Soles Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 26 m long."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Titoncere Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 32 m long."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Syrattoila Undead","legend":"Rumors speak of a lucky Undead who inhabits Syrattoila hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Jiyeh Ghoul","legend":"Elders speak of a huge Ghoul who inhabits Jiyeh hills and doesn't mind human flesh."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Nabad Hag","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a terrifying Hag who inhabits Nabad hills and keeps the region at bay."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Shahak Troll","legend":"Tales speak of a big Troll who inhabits Shahak hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Galbaoroz Troll","legend":"Tales speak of a horrifying Troll who inhabits Galbaoroz hills and prefers eating children."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Athen Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Gods of the Ancient Shark."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Aberydere Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Gods of the Ancient Shark."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Kids Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Faith of the Inherent Bison."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Abermay Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Abermawan Order."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Baalpe Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Faith of the Inherent Bison."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Iubhney Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Celtic Druidism."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Alainnerfa Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Celtic Druidism."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Brigion Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Celtic Druidism."},{"id":"marker96","name":"Sando Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Cantabrian Spirits."},{"id":"marker97","name":"Aga'um Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Faith of the Inherent Bison."},{"id":"marker98","name":"Plentziakio Panthers","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker99","name":"Epilarinata Cats","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker100","name":"Gergalenata Hyenas","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker101","name":"Vigion Wolfs","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker102","name":"Borvia Foxes","legend":"A gang of swamp bandits."},{"id":"marker103","name":"Geranna Dogs","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker104","name":"Lindorica Crows","legend":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"id":"marker105","name":"Nikka Falcons","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker106","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker107","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker108","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker109","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker110","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker111","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker112","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker113","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker114","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker115","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker116","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker117","name":"Oakley Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ቀረነየገተፐየየ ዘፐገየመበአመደጰመ ጠመዐበበለየሀሐፐመጠኀበበየጸየበፈጰጰደፈ</div>"},{"id":"marker118","name":"Clitford Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠽᡯᢡᢂᢂᠲᠳᢂᡜᡱᢑᡴᢛᡗᠮᡡᡭᡲᡮᠿᢦᠼᡝᠱᢐᡠᡔᡱᡗᠯᢤᠵᢛᠭᠪᢁᡰᠳᢡᢏᠽᢀᢠᠿᡭᡐᠾᢁᠰᠰᡮᠱᡖᢤᡏᡑᢋᡮᡰᠰᡀᡡᡯᢥᢟᠰᡰᡰᠳᢥᡑᢐᠽᢋᠩᠳᠾ</div>"},{"id":"marker119","name":"Movianiara Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc1f\udc12𐠜\ud802𐠌\udc1b\udc15\udc20\udc0f\udc25\ud802𐠅\ud802\ud802𐠭\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠩\udc2e\udc26\udc1a\udc37𐠅\udc30 𐠲\udc1f\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠑\udc01𐠙\udc0b\udc31\udc2c𐠔</div>"},{"id":"marker120","name":"Aberbarleigh Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳊⳖⳆ ⳚⳒⳁⳚⳞⳭ⳾Ⳏ ⳞⲼⳬⳄ⳹ⳆⳎⳖⲺⳚⳊⳤⳒⳤⲸⳃⳬⳢ⳩ⳭⳃⳖⲾⲺⳫⳔⳘⲴ⳧⳪ⳔⳖⳂ⳥ⳘⳘ</div>"},{"id":"marker121","name":"Diris Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ኀከ ጸሠተሠየየኀወ ረአ ነኀገተ ጰፐወጠአጠወረዐደገዐገአአገለረበየተጸሠወአተደሠኀዘዐ ጸዐጰ</div>"},{"id":"marker122","name":"Cambrarico Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠠𐠥\ud802\ud802𐠖𐠞𐠗𐠒𐠐\udc14 \udc23𐠚\udc03\udc1f\ud802𐠦\udc05\ud802\ud802𐠬\ud802\ud802𐠕𐠗\udc2d𐠰𐠈\ud802𐠷\ud802 \ud802𐠚\udc35\udc35\ud802𐠯\udc30\udc28\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠦 \udc19\udc20\ud802\ud802𐠈\ud802𐠴\ud802𐠖\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker123","name":"Aberugrefes Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡕᡴᢋᡭᡐᡞᠻᢀᢤᡏᡁ᠑ᡗᠽᠽᡙᢓᠾᢟᡖᡑᠯᡒᠵᠮ᠒ᡀᢏᠩᢦᠧᡏᠩᡡᠿᠧᠻᡆᠳᢜᠽ</div>"},{"id":"marker124","name":"Iubh Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc21𐠐\udc38\udc32\udc2a\udc23\ud802 \udc0e𐠵𐠎\ud802𐠯\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠧\ud802\ud802𐠟\ud802𐠊\udc20\ud802𐠞\udc20\udc32𐠛𐠳\udc1c\ud802 𐠧\udc30\ud802𐠴\udc2a\udc14 \udc15\udc2c𐠴\udc0d\ud802𐠞\udc34 \udc1f\ud802\ud802\ud802 𐠅\udc16\udc0b\ud802𐠫𐠅\ud802𐠖</div>"},{"id":"marker125","name":"Ranonis Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802  \ud802 \udc34\udc11\udc19\udc2f \udc29\udc0c𐠵 \udc2e𐠡𐠝\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠢\udc02\udc1f 𐠃\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠅\udc03𐠅 \ud802𐠊\ud802\ud802𐠿\udc11\udc21\udc33\udc31𐠸\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker126","name":"Tungripoma Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሠፐ ነጠየፈፐዘደተመፀበቀጠፀበአቀዘፈከ ሠሰሐዐጠመፐዐጸአ ገ የሀቀቀበረወ  ዐየአፐጰተነለዘፀፈ በጠከለዐረጰሐሠሠጸ</div>"},{"id":"marker127","name":"Tyralyrian Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳇ Ⳏ⳧ⲺⲾⳲⳀⳄⲼ⳥ⳀⳆⳘⳤⳃ⳩⳪ⳞⳁⳐⳊ⳾ⳒⳜⳲⳖⲺⳚⳭⳀⳭ ⳁⲶⳭⲸⲼ⳥ⳀⳆⳀ ⳆⳭⳂ⳩ⳜⳆⳠⲴⳄⳬⳘⳈⳀⳚⳊⳔ⳾ⳎⳀⲾⳖⲼⳈⳊⲴⳤⳂⳌⲾ ⳫⳘⳬⳄⳊⳌⳭⲾⳖⳘⳂⳃⳚ⳥Ⳣ</div>"},{"id":"marker128","name":"Ahavonverga Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༆༸༗༴༱༘༤༳༜༜༸༣༓༊༅༦༺༮༜༇༊༐༮༒༶༼༔༕༕༐༿༘༻༇༣་་༙༼༈༬༷༈༶༰༯༆༻༦༵༶༼༴༄༗༸༴༰༉༲༨༗༺༜</div>"},{"id":"marker129","name":"Aruran Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༑༼༙༽༢༸༿༚༁༴༨༂༡༹ༀ༆༁༶༣༷༶༽༗༢༄༸༬༵༠༬༐༐༬༼༄༘༰༦༮་༡༲༅༯༼༱༓༙༲༫༅༃༐༘༆༱༅༮༕༠༾༼༃༩༵༖ༀ༴༛༅༬༃༴༫༵༴༧༒༰༅༲༾༲༌༮༒༫༡༓༮༣༒༱༘༤༕</div>"},{"id":"marker130","name":"Situtubla Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc34\ud802 \udc03\udc18\ud802𐠨𐠅\udc10\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠱\ud802\ud802𐠴\udc3c\udc14\udc2e𐠍\udc2d\udc3c\udc12\udc24 \ud802𐠳𐠮\udc2a\udc2a\udc23\udc12\udc16𐠘𐠡𐠡𐠅\udc18\ud802𐠤\udc13\udc33\ud802\ud802𐠄\udc05\ud802\ud802𐠜\udc23𐠊\ud802 \udc02 \ud802\ud802𐠩\udc29\ud802𐠠\udc14\udc16 𐠒\udc16𐠨\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker131","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker132","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker133","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker134","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker135","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker136","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker137","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker138","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker139","name":"Ruined Castle","legend":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker140","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker141","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker142","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker143","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold ri